                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Which Shopify theme is best for skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Impulse or Warehouse premium ($280) for content + collection templates. Dawn (free) works for lighter catalogue. Custom theme (Rs 3-8L) only if brand + 100+ SKU catalogue justify.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does a skincare Shopify store cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 2-4 lakh boutique (4-6 weeks). Rs 4-8 lakh mid-market (6-10 weeks). Rs 8-15 lakh enterprise (10-16 weeks). Rs 12-25 lakh headless. Content + photography separate.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need skin quiz + routine builder from day one?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes. Lifts AOV 40-60% + reduces returns. Tolstoy + Octane AI + Rebuy apps. Rs 5-25K / month. Critical for skincare Shopify conversion.</p>
                                        <h3>Which subscription app should we use?</h3>
                                        <p>Bold Subscriptions + Recharge + Shopify Subscriptions. Rs 5-25K / month. Skincare subscription = 3-5x LTV lift vs one-time purchase.</p>
                                        <h3>What apps must a skincare Shopify have?</h3>
                                        <p>Skin quiz (Tolstoy / Octane) + subscription (Bold / Recharge) + WhatsApp (Interakt) + reviews (Judge.me / Yotpo) + Klaviyo email + shipping insurance (Route). Total Rs 30-100K/month tooling.</p>
                                        <h3>Can we sell Rs 5K+ skincare on Shopify checkout?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes standard Razorpay + Cashfree handles Rs 5-25K skincare AOV. EMI + BNPL for higher AOV. WhatsApp video consultation for premium tier.</p>
                                        <h3>Should we use Shopify or WooCommerce for skincare?</h3>
                                        <p>Shopify for 90% of skincare D2C. Better subscription + quiz + routine-builder ecosystem. WooCommerce only if editorial + content is core.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs build skincare Shopify?</h3>
                                        <p>Skincare-specialist Shopify with skin quiz + subscription + WhatsApp routine + AR (if applicable) + certification display + ingredient encyclopaedia. See <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php">skincare vertical page</a>.</p>
